--- make
description: Methods added to a type, such as date or list, in extensions/: every script in the project gets them
category: Scripts and data
usage: <type> [--methods json,is_weekend]
--methods: The methods to start with, comma separated. Each returns $this until you fill it in
example: kscript make extension date --methods json,is_weekend
example: kscript make extension text/string --methods slug
example: kscript make extension list --methods second
to: {{ paths.extensions }}/{{ dir }}{{ name }}{{ ext }}
hint: Every script in the project now has these methods: {{#each methods}}->{{ item | snake }}(){{#unless last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}{{#unless methods}}add fn lines inside the block{{/unless}}. $this is the {{ name }} each one is called on
---
/// Methods for every {{ name }} in the project. $this is the {{ name }} a method is called on.
extend {{ name }} {
{{#each methods}}
  /// What {{ item | snake }} does.
  fn {{ item | snake }}() => $this
{{else}}
  // fn json() => $this->to_json()
{{/each}}
}
